# Git ownership

- Never run `git commit`, `git push`, `git tag`, or force-push. The repo owner does every commit and push.
- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or any `cursoragent@cursor.com` trailer.
- Leave changes in the working tree and tell the owner what to commit.
